{
  "name": "gfx-rs",
  "description": "A high-performance, type-safe, and bindless graphics abstraction layer for Rust that provides a unified API over low-level backends like OpenGL. It leverages procedural macros to enforce static safety for shader parameters and vertex formats, effectively eliminating common pitfalls associated with global state and manual resource binding. The architecture is designed to be orthogonal to windowing contexts and math libraries, focusing on minimal-latency rendering operations.",
